# Risen Necroregent's "Max speed — At the beginning of your end step, create a 2/2 black Zombie creature token" works only
# while it is on the battlefield (CR 702.178a, 113.6): unlike Mutant Surveyor's, it does not work from the graveyard. Cast on
# turn 1 (speed 1), a Lightning Bolt to Bot2 on turns 1, 3 and 5 takes Bot1 to max speed on turn 5, and Bot1 then has Diabolic
# Edict make itself sacrifice its only creature, the Necroregent. At max speed but with the card in the graveyard, the end
# steps of turns 5 and 7 make no Zombie.

